{"unit_id":"monk233__dsh-plugin-manager#card-zh","repo":"monk233/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"5b25a8ffad509a0ac00b640198cde41a405b3ffa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-manager 是一款 DSH Web 插件，提供 profile 插件管理页面。它在设置页列出插件状态，并通过宿主端 JSON API 读取和修改 profile 的 cordis.patch.yml。主要功能包括按名称或 id 搜索、查看启用与加载状态、启用或禁用条目，以及删除用户插入的插件行；受保护的内置组件不可删除。适合希望直接从 Web 设置管理 profile 组合的 DSH 用户。安装到 Web profile 后需要 DSH 的 loader、文件系统和 Web 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:300-307","lib/index.js:193-200","lib/index.js:202-257"]}
{"unit_id":"monk233__dsh-plugin-manager#card-en","repo":"monk233/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"5b25a8ffad509a0ac00b640198cde41a405b3ffa","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-manager adds a DSH Web settings page to search profile plugins, view their states, and enable, disable, or remove user-inserted entries by updating cordis.patch.yml. Protected built-in entries cannot be deleted. It requires DSH loader, filesystem, and web server services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:300-307","lib/index.js:193-200","lib/index.js:202-257"]}
